Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"mongodb__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无原生；Atlan/Manta 第三方集成）。 无原生血缘，靠 Atlan/Manta 等第三方 社区共识。 Atlas Data Federation 元数据可被采集 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无原生；Atlan/Manta 第三方集成）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生血缘，靠 Atlan/Manta 等第三方 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Atlas Data Federation 元数据可被采集 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native; Atlan/Manta third-party integration). No native lineage; third parties like Atlan/Manta <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Atlas Data Federation metadata can be h…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native; Atlan/Manta third-party integration).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native lineage; third parties like Atlan/Manta <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Atlas Data Federation metadata can be harvested <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。自建：mongodump/mongorestore（逻辑）、文件系统快照（物理，需 journaling + 锁或副本集一致性配合）、mongoexport；Atlas：连续备份 + PITR（时间点恢复）、按需快照。恢复速度取决于数据量与拓扑（分片集群恢复需逐分片协调，官方无统一 RTO 口径——厂商无口径，按自测）。来源等级：官方…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。自建：<code>mongodump</code>/<code>mongorestore</code>（逻辑）、文件系统快照（物理，需 journaling + 锁或副本集一致性配合）、<code>mongoexport</code>；Atlas：连续备份 + PITR（时间点恢复）、按需快照。恢复速度取决于数据量与拓扑（分片集群恢复需逐分片协调，官方无统一 RTO 口径——<strong>厂商无口径，按自测</strong>）。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Self-hosted: mongodump/mongorestore (logical), filesystem snapshots (physical, requires journaling + locking or replica-set consistency coordination), mongoexp…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Self-hosted: <code>mongodump</code>/<code>mongorestore</code> (logical), filesystem snapshots (physical, requires journaling + locking or replica-set consistency coordination), <code>mongoexport</code>; Atlas: continuous backups + PITR (point-in-time recovery), on-demand snapshots. Recovery speed depends on data size and topology (restoring a sharded cluster requires per-shard coordination; there is no official RTO statement — <strong>no vendor position; judge from your own tests</strong>). Evidence level: <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（默认存算一体；Atlas Infinite（Public Preview）提供分离选项）。 副本集/分片本地盘，经典存算一体 官方文档。 Atlas Infinite（2026-09-29 随 MongoDB 9.0 发布，Public Preview）：计算与存储分离、各自独立扩展；现有 Atlas 更名为 Atlas Core；采…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（默认存算一体；Atlas Infinite（Public Preview）提供分离选项）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>副本集/分片本地盘，经典存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Atlas Infinite（2026-09-29 随 MongoDB 9.0 发布，Public Preview）：计算与存储分离、各自独立扩展；现有 Atlas 更名为 Atlas Core；采用无需改应用代码；现阶段仅 AWS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。仍为预览版、尚未 GA，生产采用受限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Coupled by default; Atlas Infinite (public preview) separates). Replica sets/sharded clusters on local disks; classically coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Atlas Infini…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Coupled by default; Atlas Infinite (public preview) separates).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Replica sets/sharded clusters on local disks; classically coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Atlas Infinite (launched 2026-09-29 alongside MongoDB 9.0, public preview): compute and storage scale independently; existing Atlas renamed Atlas Core; no application code changes to adopt; currently AWS only <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Still in preview, not GA — limited for production adoption <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（文档+向量+全文+时序）。 文档原生，Atlas Vector Search、Atlas Search（全文）、时序集合 官方文档。 无原生图引擎 社区共识。 Atlas Agent Engine（2026-09-29 随 9.0 发布，Public Preview）：AI agent 应用层编排——agent 执行、跨会话记忆（Vo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（文档+向量+全文+时序）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文档原生，Atlas Vector Search、Atlas Search（全文）、时序集合 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生图引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Atlas Agent Engine（2026-09-29 随 9.0 发布，Public Preview）：AI agent 应用层编排——agent 执行、跨会话记忆（Voyage AI embedding + 原生检索）、统一治理控制面；模型中立（MCP/A2A，自带模型），<strong>不是数据库内核内 AI</strong>。平衡项：9.0 无内置模型微调（Omdia 分析师 Stephen Catanzano 指证）、无原生模型托管（McKnight Consulting 分析师 William McKnight 指证），均经 TechTarget 2026-09-29 报道 <code>第三方分析</code>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Document + vector + full-text + time-series). Native documents, Atlas Vector Search, Atlas Search (full-text), time-series collections <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No nati…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Document + vector + full-text + time-series).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Native documents, Atlas Vector Search, Atlas Search (full-text), time-series collections <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native graph engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Atlas Agent Engine (launched 2026-09-29 with 9.0, public preview): application-layer AI agent orchestration — agent execution, cross-session memory (Voyage AI embeddings + native retrieval), unified governance control plane; model-neutral (MCP/A2A, bring your own model), <strong>not in-database AI</strong>. Balancing items: no built-in model fine-tuning (flagged as missing by Omdia analyst Stephen Catanzano) and no native model hosting (flagged by McKnight Consulting analyst William McKnight), both reported by TechTarget on 2026-09-29 <code>(third-party analysis)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（自建无计费，成本=硬件+人力自理）。 开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。社区共识 Atlas 托管版按量计费，支持标签归因与预算告警。厂商口径 Atlas Infinite（Public Preview）引入新计费模型：按实际计算+存储消耗计费，而非按峰值预配付费；官方称内部测试中其每美元吞吐为 Atlas …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（自建无计费，成本=硬件+人力自理）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Atlas 托管版按量计费，支持标签归因与预算告警。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Atlas Infinite（Public Preview）引入新计费模型：按实际计算+存储消耗计费，而非按峰值预配付费；官方称内部测试中其每美元吞吐为 Atlas Core 的 189%——<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>，无独立第三方复现 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No metering; hardware plus labor). Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> At…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No metering; hardware plus labor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Atlas managed edition meters usage with tag attribution and budget alerts. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Atlas Infinite (public preview) introduces consumption-based pricing: billed on actual compute + storage consumption rather than peak-provisioned capacity; MongoDB claims internal tests show 189% more throughput per dollar than Atlas Core — <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>, no independent third-party reproduction <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方驱动最全；BI Connector 给 JDBC）。 官方 Java/Python/Node/Go/C# 驱动业界最全之一 官方文档。 BI Connector 提供 JDBC/ODBC 给 BI 工具 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（官方驱动最全；BI Connector 给 JDBC）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>官方 Java/Python/Node/Go/C# 驱动业界最全之一 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BI Connector 提供 JDBC/ODBC 给 BI 工具 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Most complete official drivers; BI Connector for JDBC). Among the most complete official Java/Python/Node/Go/C# drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. BI Connector exposes J…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Most complete official drivers; BI Connector for JDBC).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Among the most complete official Java/Python/Node/Go/C# drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BI Connector exposes JDBC/ODBC for BI tools <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（On-Demand MV（$merge 模拟））。 无原生 MV；On-Demand Materialized Views 用 $merge 聚合模拟 官方文档。 刷新调度与一致性自建 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（On-Demand MV（$merge 模拟））。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生 MV；On-Demand Materialized Views 用 $merge 聚合模拟 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>刷新调度与一致性自建 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (On-Demand MVs via $merge). No native MVs; On-Demand MVs simulate via $merge <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Scheduling and consistency DIY <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (On-Demand MVs via $merge).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native MVs; On-Demand MVs simulate via $merge <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Scheduling and consistency DIY <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Atlas AWS/GCP/Azure，多云标杆）。 Atlas 横跨 AWS/GCP/Azure，可跨云部署集群 官方文档。 开源/企业版任意云自建 官方文档。 跨云分片集群延迟与费用都要评估 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Atlas AWS/GCP/Azure，多云标杆）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Atlas 横跨 AWS/GCP/Azure，可跨云部署集群 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>开源/企业版任意云自建 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云分片集群延迟与费用都要评估 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Atlas on AWS/GCP/Azure; the multi-cloud benchmark). Atlas spans AWS/GCP/Azure with cross-cloud cluster deployment <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Open-source/enterprise self-…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Atlas on AWS/GCP/Azure; the multi-cloud benchmark).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Atlas spans AWS/GCP/Azure with cross-cloud cluster deployment <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Open-source/enterprise self-hosted on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Evaluate latency and cost for cross-cloud sharded clusters <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（文档级乐观并发，服务端自动重试串行化）。 并发控制原语是 WiredTiger 文档级 MVCC + 乐观并发：并发改同一文档时后来者快照过期，存储引擎返回 WT_ROLLBACK，mongod 服务端在 writeConflictRetry 循环里按有界指数退避自动重试直到成功——重试归属是内核/服务端，应用无感知，这是热点文档的原…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（文档级乐观并发，服务端自动重试串行化）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发控制原语是 WiredTiger 文档级 MVCC + 乐观并发：并发改同一文档时后来者快照过期，存储引擎返回 WT_ROLLBACK，mongod 服务端在 writeConflictRetry 循环里按有界指数退避自动重试直到成功——重试归属是内核/服务端，应用无感知，这是热点文档的原生串行化机制。边界：6.0 起极端缓存压力下冲突升级为 TemporarilyUnavailable，服务端只重试 <code>temporarilyUnavailableMaxRetries</code> 次后把错误抛给客户端（应用必须处理）；多文档事务冲突直接返回 WriteConflict（112），由驱动 <code>withTransaction</code> 重试整个事务（驱动层），代价是丢弃部分工作重来<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减形态：N 个线程同时改同一文档约产生 N²/2 的无效重试工作量<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>，吞吐不随核数增长、CPU 被重试烧掉，加机器不救单文档热点。分片集群下热片键固定在一个 chunk，balancer 无法拆分（jumbo chunk），单分片成硬瓶颈<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解：未找到官方命名或文档化的热点自动打散、排队化或专用参数机制的证据（不是查证为无）；串行化靠“冲突即重试”硬扛，靠应用层建模。<code>transactionLifetimeLimitSeconds=60</code> 秒是事务超时兜底，不是热点开关。可观测性侧 <code>db.serverStatus().transactions</code> 的 totalAborted/totalStarted 暴露冲突率——检测手段。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>应用层模式与代价：热计数器拆文档/分片计数（代价：读时聚合）；&quot;每事件一文档&quot;的追加模型替代&quot;单文档反复 <code>$inc</code>&quot;（代价：读时聚合、存储膨胀）；分片键用哈希避免热片（代价：范围查询变散）；文档保持 KB 级——WiredTiger 每次更新重写整个文档，大文档热点等于缓存与 IO 双重放大（代价：建模约束）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported(Document-level optimistic concurrency with server-side automatic retry). The concurrency primitive is WiredTiger document-level MVCC plus optimistic concurrency…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>(Document-level optimistic concurrency with server-side automatic retry).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive is WiredTiger document-level MVCC plus optimistic concurrency: when concurrent writers hit one document, the loser&#x27;s snapshot goes stale, the storage engine returns WT_ROLLBACK, and the mongod server automatically retries in a writeConflictRetry loop with bounded exponential backoff until success — retry ownership sits with the core/server, invisible to the application. This is the native serialization mechanism for hot documents. Boundaries: since 6.0, conflicts under extreme cache pressure escalate to TemporarilyUnavailable, which the server retries only <code>temporarilyUnavailableMaxRetries</code> times before surfacing the error to the client (the application must handle it); multi-document transaction conflicts return WriteConflict (112) directly, retried as a whole transaction by the driver&#x27;s <code>withTransaction</code> (driver layer), at the cost of discarding partial work and restarting <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Decay shape: N threads updating one document generate roughly N²/2 wasted retry work — throughput does not scale with core count and CPUs burn on retries; adding machines does not rescue a single-document hotspot. In a sharded cluster a hot shard key pins to one chunk that the balancer cannot split (jumbo chunk), making one shard a hard bottleneck (community tested).</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation: no evidence found for an officially named or documented automatic hotspot spreading, queueing, or dedicated parameter mechanism (not verified absent); serialization is brute-forced via &quot;conflict means retry&quot;, and modeling is the application&#x27;s job. <code>transactionLifetimeLimitSeconds=60</code> is a transaction timeout backstop, not a hotspot switch. Observability exposes conflict rates via <code>totalAborted</code>/<code>totalStarted</code> in <code>db.serverStatus().transactions</code> — detection, not mitigation (to be verified).</li>\n<li>Application patterns and costs: split hot counters across documents/sharded counters (cost: read-time aggregation); replace &quot;repeated <code>$inc</code> on one document&quot; with a one-document-per-event append model (cost: read-time aggregation, storage bloat); hashed shard keys to avoid hot shards (cost: scattered range queries); keep documents at KB scale — WiredTiger rewrites the entire document on every update, so a hot large document amplifies both cache and IO (cost: modeling discipline) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。自建：mongostat/mongotop、Database Profiler（慢查询）、db.currentOp()、FTDC（诊断数据捕获）、官方 MongoDB Cloud Manager / Ops Manager（企业级监控自动化）；Atlas 内置监控、Performance Advisor、慢查询分析。来源等级：官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。自建：<code>mongostat</code>/<code>mongotop</code>、Database Profiler（慢查询）、<code>db.currentOp()</code>、FTDC（诊断数据捕获）、官方 MongoDB Cloud Manager / Ops Manager（企业级监控自动化）；Atlas 内置监控、Performance Advisor、慢查询分析。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Self-hosted: mongostat/mongotop, Database Profiler (slow queries), db.currentOp(), FTDC (full-time diagnostic data capture), official MongoDB Cloud Manager / O…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Self-hosted: <code>mongostat</code>/<code>mongotop</code>, Database Profiler (slow queries), <code>db.currentOp()</code>, FTDC (full-time diagnostic data capture), official MongoDB Cloud Manager / Ops Manager (enterprise-grade monitoring automation); Atlas has built-in monitoring, Performance Advisor, and slow-query analysis. Evidence level: <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（驱动侧连接池）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（驱动侧连接池）。无服务端内置连接池中间件概念；各官方驱动自带连接池（maxPoolSize 默认 100 等驱动相关参数），长连接复用；官方建议应用层保持单例 MongoClient。超大规模连接场景靠横向加应用实例或第三方代理（如自研/Proxy），官方无 pgBouncer 式标配。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（驱动侧连接池）</strong>。无服务端内置连接池中间件概念；各官方驱动自带连接池（<code>maxPoolSize</code> 默认 100 等驱动相关参数），长连接复用；官方建议应用层保持单例 MongoClient。超大规模连接场景靠横向加应用实例或第三方代理（如自研/Proxy），官方无 pgBouncer 式标配。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (driver-side connection pooling). There is no server-side built-in connection-pool middleware concept; every official driver ships its own connection pool (maxP…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (driver-side connection pooling)</strong>. There is no server-side built-in connection-pool middleware concept; every official driver ships its own connection pool (<code>maxPoolSize</code> defaults to 100 and other driver-specific parameters), with long-lived connection reuse; the official recommendation is to keep a single MongoClient singleton at the application layer. Very large-scale connection scenarios rely on horizontal scaling of application instances or third-party proxies (self-built/proxy), and there is no official pgBouncer-style standard. Evidence level: <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（有限制）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（有限制）。多文档 ACID 事务：副本集 4.0 起、分片集群 4.2 起；隔离级别为快照隔离（snapshot）；默认 transactionLifetimeLimitSeconds=60 秒，超时自动 abort（可调，但调大增加冲突与缓存压力）。单文档写入天然原子。分片事务不支持某些操作（如跨分片的特定 DDL），以官方&quot;事务限…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（有限制）</strong>。多文档 ACID 事务：副本集 4.0 起、分片集群 4.2 起；隔离级别为快照隔离（snapshot）；<strong>默认 <code>transactionLifetimeLimitSeconds=60</code> 秒</strong>，超时自动 abort（可调，但调大增加冲突与缓存压力）。单文档写入天然原子。<strong>分片事务不支持某些操作</strong>（如跨分片的特定 DDL），以官方&quot;事务限制&quot;文档为准。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (with limitations). Multi-document ACID transactions: replica sets since 4.0, sharded clusters since 4.2; the isolation level is snapshot isolation; default tra…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (with limitations)</strong>. Multi-document ACID transactions: replica sets since 4.0, sharded clusters since 4.2; the isolation level is snapshot isolation; <strong>default <code>transactionLifetimeLimitSeconds=60</code> seconds</strong>, timed-out transactions abort automatically (tunable, but raising it increases contention and cache pressure). Single-document writes are naturally atomic. <strong>Sharded transactions do not support certain operations</strong> (such as specific cross-shard DDL); defer to the official &quot;transaction limitations&quot; documentation. Evidence level: <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。副本集主从复制（异步 oplog 拉取，非 Raft/Paxos 共识写，选举用 Raft-like 投票协议）；一致性可调：写关注 w:1（默认单机确认）/w:majority（5.0 起为默认写关注，仲裁节点等拓扑下有例外）/w:all，读关注 local/majority/snapshot/linearizable。强一致需显式…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。副本集主从复制（异步 oplog 拉取，非 Raft/Paxos 共识写，选举用 Raft-like 投票协议）；一致性可调：写关注 <code>w:1</code>（默认单机确认）/<code>w:majority</code>（5.0 起为默认写关注，仲裁节点等拓扑下有例外）/<code>w:all</code>，读关注 <code>local</code>/<code>majority</code>/<code>snapshot</code>/<code>linearizable</code>。强一致需显式 <code>w:majority</code> + <code>readConcern:majority</code> 组合，默认配置不提供线性一致。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Replica-set primary/secondary replication (asynchronous oplog pulling, not Raft/Paxos consensus writes; elections use a Raft-like voting protocol); tunable con…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Replica-set primary/secondary replication (asynchronous oplog pulling, not Raft/Paxos consensus writes; elections use a Raft-like voting protocol); tunable consistency: write concern <code>w:1</code> (default single-node acknowledgment) / <code>w:majority</code> (the default write concern since 5.0, with exceptions for topologies such as arbiter nodes) / <code>w:all</code>, read concern <code>local</code> / <code>majority</code> / <code>snapshot</code> / <code>linearizable</code>. Strong consistency requires the explicit <code>w:majority</code> + <code>readConcern:majority</code> combination; the default configuration does not provide linearizability. Evidence level: <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mongodb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。纵向（加配置）与横向（分片集群：mongos 路由 + config servers + shards）兼具；分片扩容在线（加分片后 balancer 自动迁移 chunk），但见深水区一：分片键选错则&quot;扩了也白扩&quot;。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。纵向（加配置）与横向（分片集群：mongos 路由 + config servers + shards）兼具；分片扩容在线（加分片后 balancer 自动迁移 chunk），但见深水区一：分片键选错则&quot;扩了也白扩&quot;。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Vertical (bigger machines) and horizontal (sharded clusters: mongos routers + config servers + shards) both; shard scaling is online (the balancer automaticall…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Vertical (bigger machines) and horizontal (sharded clusters: mongos routers + config servers + shards) both; shard scaling is online (the balancer automatically migrates chunks after adding shards) — but see deep-dive 1: if the shard key is chosen wrong, &quot;you scaled for nothing.&quot; Evidence level: <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> + <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">有：InnoDB 表空间静态加密，两级密钥结构（tablespace key 存于表空间头部，由 master key 加密；支持主密钥轮换）官方文档。覆盖范围：表空间、doublewrite、系统表空间、redo、undo；binlog/relay log、审计日志加密需分别配置 官方文档。 所有 Edition（含社区版）都有本地文件…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>有：InnoDB 表空间静态加密，两级密钥结构（tablespace key 存于表空间头部，由 master key 加密；支持主密钥轮换）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。覆盖范围：表空间、doublewrite、系统表空间、redo、undo；binlog/relay log、审计日志加密需分别配置 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>所有 Edition（含社区版）都有本地文件型 keyring（<code>component_keyring_file</code>/<code>keyring_file</code>）；Enterprise 额外提供加密密码保护文件、KMIP、Oracle Key Vault、AWS KMS 等 keyring 后端 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>社区版具备表空间加密，但<strong>本地文件 keyring 不等于合规级外部 KMS/HSM</strong>；密钥丢失即数据不可恢复 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>TDE 不保护运行中内存、授权 SQL 用户或传输中的数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>云托管注意：RDS/Aurora MySQL 不支持 MySQL 原生 keyring/TDE，改用云盘 KMS 加密替代——这是云方案差异，不是 MySQL 内核缺陷 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported: InnoDB tablespace data-at-rest encryption with a two-level key hierarchy (tablespace key stored in the tablespace header, encrypted by the master key; master k…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Supported: InnoDB tablespace data-at-rest encryption with a two-level key hierarchy (tablespace key stored in the tablespace header, encrypted by the master key; master key rotation supported) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Coverage: tablespaces, doublewrite, system tablespace, redo, undo; binlog/relay log and audit log encryption each require separate configuration <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>All editions (including Community) ship a local file-based keyring (<code>component_keyring_file</code> / <code>keyring_file</code>); Enterprise additionally provides encrypted password-protected key files, KMIP, Oracle Key Vault, AWS KMS and other keyring backends <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Community Edition has tablespace encryption, but <strong>a local file keyring is not a compliance-grade external KMS/HSM</strong>; losing the key means the data is unrecoverable <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>TDE does not protect in-memory data, authorized SQL users, or data in transit <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud hosting caveat: RDS/Aurora MySQL do not support MySQL&#x27;s native keyring/TDE and instead use cloud-disk KMS encryption — this is a cloud-offering difference, not a MySQL kernel deficiency <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">支持 TLS 连接、证书与 cipher 配置；MySQL 8.4 移除了 TLS 1.0/1.1 社区共识。 caching_sha2_password 的完整认证流程需要安全连接（TLS）或 RSA 密钥交换，否则老客户端可能连不上——这是 8.0→8.4 升级最常见的连接中断原因之一 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>支持 TLS 连接、证书与 cipher 配置；MySQL 8.4 移除了 TLS 1.0/1.1 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li><code>caching_sha2_password</code> 的完整认证流程需要安全连接（TLS）或 RSA 密钥交换，否则老客户端可能连不上——这是 8.0→8.4 升级最常见的连接中断原因之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">TLS connections supported, with certificate and cipher configuration; MySQL 8.4 removed TLS 1.0/1.1 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. The full caching_sha2_password authentication f…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>TLS connections supported, with certificate and cipher configuration; MySQL 8.4 removed TLS 1.0/1.1 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The full <code>caching_sha2_password</code> authentication flow requires a secure connection (TLS) or RSA key exchange; otherwise older clients may fail to connect — one of the most common causes of connection breakage when upgrading from 8.0 to 8.4 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（协议是事实标准，但家族已分化）</span><p class=\"snippet\">MySQL 协议 + SQL 方言是生态事实标准：驱动、ORM、工具链最全 社区共识。 分化现实：MariaDB 已走远（GTID、系统表、优化器行为多处不兼容）；Aurora MySQL 线路兼容但存储引擎完全不同（故障行为、性能特征不能直接套用）；Percona Server 紧跟上游、基本可视为&quot;MySQL+补丁&quot; 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>MySQL 协议 + SQL 方言是生态事实标准：驱动、ORM、工具链最全 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>分化现实：MariaDB 已走远（GTID、系统表、优化器行为多处不兼容）；Aurora MySQL 线路兼容但存储引擎完全不同（故障行为、性能特征不能直接套用）；Percona Server 紧跟上游、基本可视为&quot;MySQL+补丁&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">The MySQL protocol + SQL dialect is the ecosystem de facto standard: drivers, ORMs, toolchains are the most complete <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Divergence reality: MariaDB ha…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>The MySQL protocol + SQL dialect is the ecosystem de facto standard: drivers, ORMs, toolchains are the most complete <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Divergence reality: MariaDB has drifted far (GTID, system tables, optimizer behavior all incompatible in places); Aurora MySQL is wire-compatible but has a completely different storage engine (failure behavior and performance characteristics cannot be assumed transferable); Percona Server tracks upstream closely and is basically &quot;MySQL + patches&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（双轨清晰）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Community：GPLv2，功能完整但无官方审计/线程池/企业级 keyring 后端/PAM-LDAP/商业备份工具 社区共识。 Enterprise Edition：商业订阅，含上述企业插件 + MySQL Enterprise Monitor + 官方支持（LTS：Premier 5 年 + Extended 3 年）官方文档。…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Community：GPLv2，功能完整但无官方审计/线程池/企业级 keyring 后端/PAM-LDAP/商业备份工具 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Enterprise Edition：商业订阅，含上述企业插件 + MySQL Enterprise Monitor + 官方支持（LTS：Premier 5 年 + Extended 3 年）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>云：MySQL HeatWave（OCI/AWS 上的托管 MySQL + 内存加速/Lakehouse），Oracle 的云叙事主力 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Community: GPLv2, feature-complete but without official audit / thread pool / enterprise-grade keyring backends / PAM-LDAP / commercial backup tools <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Community: GPLv2, feature-complete but without official audit / thread pool / enterprise-grade keyring backends / PAM-LDAP / commercial backup tools <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Enterprise Edition: commercial subscription, includes the above enterprise plugins + MySQL Enterprise Monitor + official support (LTS: Premier 5 years + Extended 3 years) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud: MySQL HeatWave (managed MySQL on OCI/AWS + in-memory acceleration/Lakehouse), Oracle&#x27;s flagship cloud narrative <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方文档无中文版 待验证（未找到官方中文文档证据，标&quot;查证为无&quot;而非&quot;未找到&quot;需再确认，暂标待验证）。 中文社区资料丰富（博客、专栏、翻译），但版本滞后于 8.4/9.x 新特性是常态 社区共识。 ---</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方文档无中文版 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>（未找到官方中文文档证据，标&quot;查证为无&quot;而非&quot;未找到&quot;需再确认，暂标待验证）。</li>\n<li>中文社区资料丰富（博客、专栏、翻译），但版本滞后于 8.4/9.x 新特性是常态 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr/></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">No Chinese version of the official documentation <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span> (no evidence of official Chinese docs found; whether to mark this &quot;verified absent&quot; vs &quot;not found&quot; needs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>No Chinese version of the official documentation <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span> (no evidence of official Chinese docs found; whether to mark this &quot;verified absent&quot; vs &quot;not found&quot; needs reconfirmation — temporarily marked to-be-verified).</li>\n<li>Chinese community materials are abundant (blogs, columns, translations), but lagging behind 8.4/9.x new features is the norm <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr/></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">点查/短事务：单机 sysbench 点查可达数万 QPS 量级，P99 毫秒级（视硬件与调优）社区实测。 读扩展靠主从复制加从库；写是单机上限，靠分片中间件（ShardingSphere/DBLE）或业务分片 社区共识。 瓶颈：大事务、长 DDL（8.0 Instant DDL 缓解部分场景）、单表过大 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>点查/短事务：单机 sysbench 点查可达数万 QPS 量级，P99 毫秒级（视硬件与调优）<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>读扩展靠主从复制加从库；写是单机上限，靠分片中间件（ShardingSphere/DBLE）或业务分片 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>瓶颈：大事务、长 DDL（8.0 Instant DDL 缓解部分场景）、单表过大 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Point lookups/short transactions: tens of thousands of QPS per node in sysbench point-select, P99 in milliseconds (hardware/tuning dependent) <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>. Read sca…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Point lookups/short transactions: tens of thousands of QPS per node in sysbench point-select, P99 in milliseconds (hardware/tuning dependent) <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n<li>Read scaling via async replicas; single-node write ceiling — scale writes with sharding middleware (ShardingSphere/DBLE) or application sharding <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Bottlenecks: large transactions, long DDL (8.0 Instant DDL helps some cases), oversized single tables <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">社区版/企业版（Oracle）：无公开的国测/信创认证信息；等保合规由部署方测评 待验证。 各云厂商的托管 MySQL（RDS 等）继承云厂商的等保三级/可信云资质 厂商口径。 国际：Oracle 云体系的 SOC2/ISO 等适用于 Oracle 运营的 MySQL HeatWave 云服务 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>社区版/企业版（Oracle）：无公开的国测/信创认证信息；等保合规由部署方测评 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>各云厂商的托管 MySQL（RDS 等）继承云厂商的等保三级/可信云资质 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>国际：Oracle 云体系的 SOC2/ISO 等适用于 Oracle 运营的 MySQL HeatWave 云服务 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">Community/Enterprise editions (Oracle): no public information on Chinese national testing/trusted-innovation certification; MLPS (等保) compliance is the deployer&#x27;s respons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Community/Enterprise editions (Oracle): no public information on Chinese national testing/trusted-innovation certification; MLPS (等保) compliance is the deployer&#x27;s responsibility <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n<li>Managed MySQL offerings inherit their cloud provider&#x27;s MLPS Level 3 / Trusted Cloud qualifications <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>International: Oracle Cloud&#x27;s SOC2/ISO family covers Oracle-operated MySQL HeatWave cloud service <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">1995 年发布，2010 年随 Sun 并入 Oracle；8.0/8.4 LTS、9.x 创新版并行 社区共识。 GitHub stars 万级，生态（驱动/工具/教程）最厚 社区共识。 风险点：Oracle 主导下社区版与企业版功能分界时有争议 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>1995 年发布，2010 年随 Sun 并入 Oracle；8.0/8.4 LTS、9.x 创新版并行 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>GitHub stars 万级，生态（驱动/工具/教程）最厚 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>风险点：Oracle 主导下社区版与企业版功能分界时有争议 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Released 1995; joined Oracle via Sun in 2010; 8.0/8.4 LTS plus 9.x innovation releases <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Tens of thousands of GitHub stars; the thickest ecosystem (d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Released 1995; joined Oracle via Sun in 2010; 8.0/8.4 LTS plus 9.x innovation releases <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Tens of thousands of GitHub stars; the thickest ecosystem (drivers, tools, tutorials) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Risk: Oracle&#x27;s stewardship periodically sparks community-vs-enterprise feature-split controversies <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（互联网大厂的基本盘）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Meta（Facebook）、Wikipedia 等公开重度用户 社区共识。 曾支撑 YouTube/Twitter/Uber 早期架构，后部分迁移 社区共识。 国内：各大厂自建 MySQL 分支（阿里/腾讯）是事实标准 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Meta（Facebook）、Wikipedia 等公开重度用户 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>曾支撑 YouTube/Twitter/Uber 早期架构，后部分迁移 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>国内：各大厂自建 MySQL 分支（阿里/腾讯）是事实标准 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Public heavy users include Meta (Facebook) and Wikipedia <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Once powered early YouTube/Twitter/Uber architectures; some later migrated (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Public heavy users include Meta (Facebook) and Wikipedia <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Once powered early YouTube/Twitter/Uber architectures; some later migrated <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>China: in-house MySQL forks at major internet companies (Alibaba/Tencent) are the de-facto standard <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">备份：mysqldump/MySQL Shell/XtraBackup/Clone 插件 社区共识。 在线 DDL/迁移：gh-ost、pt-online-schema-change 社区共识。 CDC：Debezium、Canal；监控：PMM、mysqld_exporter + Prometheus 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>备份：mysqldump/MySQL Shell/XtraBackup/Clone 插件 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>在线 DDL/迁移：gh-ost、pt-online-schema-change <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>CDC：Debezium、Canal；监控：PMM、mysqld_exporter + Prometheus <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">backup/migration/C</span><p class=\"snippet\">Backup: mysqldump, MySQL Shell, XtraBackup, Clone plugin <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Online DDL/migration: gh-ost, pt-online-schema-change <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. CDC: Debezium…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Backup: mysqldump, MySQL Shell, XtraBackup, Clone plugin <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Online DDL/migration: gh-ost, pt-online-schema-change <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>CDC: Debezium, Canal; monitoring: PMM, mysqld_exporter + Prometheus <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">各云厂商 RDS（阿里/腾讯/AWS/华为）全覆盖 社区共识。 Oracle MySQL HeatWave（云原生+分析加速）厂商口径。 Serverless：PlanetScale（基于 Vitess 的 Serverless MySQL）社区共识。 DigitalOcean 计划变更（分阶段生效，注意日期）：2026-10-15 起从…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>各云厂商 RDS（阿里/腾讯/AWS/华为）全覆盖 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Oracle MySQL HeatWave（云原生+分析加速）<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless：PlanetScale（基于 Vitess 的 Serverless MySQL）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>DigitalOcean 计划变更（分阶段生效，注意日期）：<strong>2026-10-15</strong> 起从未创建过 PG/MySQL 集群的账号、<strong>2026-11-30</strong> 起全部账号，Standard Edition 新集群不可选 &gt;4 GiB 内存规格且不支持备节点/只读节点；更大规格、高可用或只读扩展只能用 Advanced Edition（2026-10-15 起 Advanced Edition 新增 8–64 GiB Basic 共享 CPU 规格）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（DigitalOcean 发布页原文）。限制生效前已创建的集群不受影响（仍可扩容、fork、加备节点/只读节点）——既有用户有一段缓冲，但新账号/新项目实际失去了 Standard Edition 的低成本高可用路径；用 API、Terraform 或 doctl 建集群的用户需在限制生效前更新代码 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DigitalOcean 托管 MySQL 8.0 将于 <strong>2026-10-30</strong> 结束支持，当天起现存 8.0 集群在各自维护窗口被强制升级到 8.4（官方称无停机，但维护窗口内可能有短暂延迟）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">RDS on every cloud vendor (Alibaba/Tencent/AWS/Huawei) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Oracle MySQL HeatWave (cloud-native + analytics acceleration) <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Serverless: Pl…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>RDS on every cloud vendor (Alibaba/Tencent/AWS/Huawei) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Oracle MySQL HeatWave (cloud-native + analytics acceleration) <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless: PlanetScale (serverless MySQL on Vitess) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>DigitalOcean plan changes (phased rollout, watch the dates): from <strong>15 October 2026</strong> for accounts that have never created a PostgreSQL/MySQL cluster, and from <strong>30 November 2026</strong> for all accounts, new Standard Edition clusters cannot use plans with more than 4 GiB of RAM or add standby/read-only nodes; larger plans, high availability, or read-only nodes require Advanced Edition (which gains 8–64 GiB Basic shared-CPU plans from 15 October 2026) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> (DigitalOcean release-notes page, verbatim). Clusters created before the restrictions reach an account are unaffected (still resizable, forkable, and eligible for standby/read-only nodes) — existing users get a buffer, but new accounts/projects effectively lose the low-cost HA path on Standard Edition; API, Terraform, and doctl users must update their code before the restrictions take effect <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DigitalOcean ends support for managed MySQL 8.0 on <strong>30 October 2026</strong>; all existing 8.0 clusters are scheduled for forced upgrades to 8.4 during their maintenance windows starting that date (no downtime claimed, brief latency possible) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">LOAD DATA INFILE、mysqlimport 是最快单机导入通道 官方文档。 mydumper/myloader 并行逻辑导入导出，社区主流 社区共识。 mysqlsh util.loadDump 支持 MySQL Shell dump 的并行加载 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>LOAD DATA INFILE、mysqlimport 是最快单机导入通道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>mydumper/myloader 并行逻辑导入导出，社区主流 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>mysqlsh util.loadDump 支持 MySQL Shell dump 的并行加载 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">LOAD DATA INFILE and mysqlimport are the fastest single-node load paths <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. mydumper/myloader for parallel logical import/export, community mainstream (commu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>LOAD DATA INFILE and mysqlimport are the fastest single-node load paths <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>mydumper/myloader for parallel logical import/export, community mainstream <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>mysqlsh util.loadDump parallel-loads MySQL Shell dumps <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（企业版分水岭）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Enterprise Audit 插件（audit_log）仅限商业版；社区版没有官方审计插件 社区共识。 社区替代方案：general log（性能开销大，不适合生产常开）、binlog（只记录变更不记录读）、Percona Server 自带的免费 Audit Log Plugin（配置键与官方不同）社区共识。 结论：合规审计需求在社…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li><strong>Enterprise Audit 插件（<code>audit_log</code>）仅限商业版</strong>；社区版没有官方审计插件 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>社区替代方案：general log（性能开销大，不适合生产常开）、binlog（只记录变更不记录读）、Percona Server 自带的免费 Audit Log Plugin（配置键与官方不同）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>结论：合规审计需求在社区版是&quot;能凑合但不体面&quot;，企业版才有一等公民方案。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">The Enterprise Audit plugin (audit_log) is commercial-only; Community Edition has no official audit plugin <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Community alternatives: the general log …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li><strong>The Enterprise Audit plugin (<code>audit_log</code>) is commercial-only</strong>; Community Edition has no official audit plugin <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Community alternatives: the general log (heavy performance overhead, unsuitable to leave on in production), binlog (records writes only, not reads), Percona Server&#x27;s free built-in Audit Log Plugin (configuration keys differ from the official one) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Conclusion: for compliance auditing, Community Edition is &quot;workable but undignified&quot;; only Enterprise has a first-class solution.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">FEDERATED 引擎可映射远端 MySQL 表，但功能/性能弱，生产少用 社区共识。 无 S3/对象存储直查、湖仓格式支持 官方文档。 MySQL HeatWave 侧有对象存储查询，是商业版能力 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>FEDERATED 引擎可映射远端 MySQL 表，但功能/性能弱，生产少用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无 S3/对象存储直查、湖仓格式支持 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>MySQL HeatWave 侧有对象存储查询，是商业版能力 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partially supporte</span><p class=\"snippet\">The FEDERATED engine maps remote MySQL tables but is weak in features/performance, rarely used in prod <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. No direct S3/object-storage or lakehouse-for…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>The FEDERATED engine maps remote MySQL tables but is weak in features/performance, rarely used in prod <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No direct S3/object-storage or lakehouse-format querying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>MySQL HeatWave offers object-storage queries as a commercial capability <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（binlog（row）生态最成熟：</span><p class=\"snippet\">row 格式 binlog 是事实标准 CDC 源 官方文档。 Debezium、Canal、Maxwell、Flink CDC 均成熟 社区共识。 GTID + 半同步下位点管理简单；大事务 binlog 膨胀是常见坑 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>row 格式 binlog 是事实标准 CDC 源 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Debezium、Canal、Maxwell、Flink CDC 均成熟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>GTID + 半同步下位点管理简单；大事务 binlog 膨胀是常见坑 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Debezium/Canal/Max</span><p class=\"snippet\">Row-format binlog is the de-facto CDC source <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Debezium, Canal, Maxwell and Flink CDC are all mature <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. GTID + semisync make position m…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Row-format binlog is the de-facto CDC source <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Debezium, Canal, Maxwell and Flink CDC are all mature <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>GTID + semisync make position management easy; huge transactions bloat binlog <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">分区表 + event 定时 DROP 分区是生产标准做法 社区共识。 无原生行级 TTL；大表 DELETE 慢且产生大量 undo/redo 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>分区表 + event 定时 DROP 分区是生产标准做法 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生行级 TTL；大表 DELETE 慢且产生大量 undo/redo <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partitioned tables + scheduled events dropping partitions is the production standard <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. No native row-level TTL; big-table DELETEs are slow and genera…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Partitioned tables + scheduled events dropping partitions is the production standard <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No native row-level TTL; big-table DELETEs are slow and generate heavy undo/redo <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">只改定义：INSTANT 只动系统表元数据、O(1)：加列（8.0.29+ 任意位置，此前仅末尾）、删列（8.0.29+ 默认 INSTANT）、重命名列（8.0.28+，同类型+同 NOT NULL 属性才保持在线）、改列 DEFAULT、ENUM/SET 末尾追加成员（存储字节不变）；上限：64 次行版本、1022 列，COMPRES…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li><strong>只改定义</strong>：INSTANT 只动系统表元数据、O(1)：加列（8.0.29+ 任意位置，此前仅末尾）、删列（8.0.29+ 默认 INSTANT）、重命名列（8.0.28+，同类型+同 NOT NULL 属性才保持在线）、改列 DEFAULT、ENUM/SET 末尾追加成员（存储字节不变）；上限：64 次行版本、1022 列，COMPRESSED/FULLTEXT/临时表除外，加自增列至少 INPLACE+LOCK=SHARED <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>重写但位置不变</strong>：建二级索引 INPLACE 后台构建 + 增量追踪 + 原子切换，LOCK=NONE 允许并发 DML（O(n) 回填，大表耗时但前台可写）；VARCHAR 扩容不跨 255 字节边界可 INPLACE，缩容走 COPY <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>搬数据</strong>：改列类型只支持 COPY（全表重建、长时间阻塞写）；主键变更、字符集转换同样重建 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。大表生产标准是 gh-ost（binlog 回放）/pt-osc（触发器），有主从延迟与触发器风险，最后的表切换仍要短暂 MDL <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>验证约束</strong>：MySQL 不支持 NOT VALID 两阶段语法（查证为无）；加 UNIQUE/普通索引走 INPLACE 在线构建、LOCK=NONE 允许并发 DML <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>规模</strong>：第二、四类代价 O(n)：小表秒级、大表数小时；即使 INPLACE 在线，回填也吃 IO 与复制带宽——&quot;测试环境在线、生产锁死&quot;的根源 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>语义</strong>：DDL 隐式提交、非事务性（8.0 原子 DDL 只保证 crash 不留半成品，不能包进事务回滚）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；三档算法在开始/提交阶段都要拿 MDL：长事务卡 DDL，排队中的 DDL 再卡住后续请求（MDL 队头阻塞）；铁律：显式 <code>ALGORITHM=INSTANT/INPLACE, LOCK=NONE</code>，不满足就失败而不是悄悄降级 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Definition-only changes: INSTANT touches metadata only, O(1): add column (any position since 8.0.29; trailing only before), drop column (INSTANT by default since 8.0.29),…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li><strong>Definition-only changes</strong>: INSTANT touches metadata only, O(1): add column (any position since 8.0.29; trailing only before), drop column (INSTANT by default since 8.0.29), rename column (since 8.0.28 — same type and nullability required to stay online), SET/DROP DEFAULT, appending ENUM/SET members at the end (storage size unchanged). Limits: 64 row versions, 1022 columns; excluded on COMPRESSED/FULLTEXT/temp tables; adding an auto-increment column needs at least INPLACE + LOCK=SHARED <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>Data rewrite, same location</strong>: secondary-index builds run INPLACE — background build + concurrent-DML tracking + atomic switch; LOCK=NONE keeps writes flowing (O(n) backfill: slow on huge tables but the app keeps writing). Extending VARCHAR stays INPLACE only if the 255-byte length boundary is not crossed; shrinking needs COPY <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>Data moves</strong>: changing a column type is COPY-only (full rebuild, long write block); PK changes and charset conversions also rebuild <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Production standard for huge tables is gh-ost (binlog replay) / pt-online-schema-change (triggers) — watch replica lag and trigger risks; the final table swap still needs a brief metadata lock <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>Constraint validation</strong>: no NOT VALID two-phase syntax in MySQL (verified absent); adding UNIQUE/secondary indexes is an online INPLACE build with LOCK=NONE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>Scale</strong>: classes 2 and 4 cost O(n) — seconds on small tables, hours on huge ones; even online INPLACE backfills consume IO and replication bandwidth. That is the root of &quot;online in staging, locked in production&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li><strong>Semantics</strong>: DDL auto-commits and is non-transactional — 8.0 atomic DDL only guarantees no half-applied dictionary on crash; you cannot roll DDL back inside a transaction <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All three algorithms take metadata locks at start/commit: long transactions block DDL, and queued DDL blocks everything behind it (MDL head-of-line blocking). Iron rule: spell out <code>ALGORITHM=INSTANT/INPLACE, LOCK=NONE</code> so violations fail loudly instead of silently degrading <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">8.0 resource group 可做线程 CPU 亲和/优先级，无内存/IO 限流 官方文档。 生产多租户靠多实例，单实例混布 noisy neighbor 常见 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>8.0 resource group 可做线程 CPU 亲和/优先级，无内存/IO 限流 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>生产多租户靠多实例，单实例混布 noisy neighbor 常见 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">8.0 resource groups do thread CPU affinity/priority; no memory/IO throttling <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Production multi-tenancy means multiple instances; noisy neighbors are commo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>8.0 resource groups do thread CPU affinity/priority; no memory/IO throttling <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Production multi-tenancy means multiple instances; noisy neighbors are common on shared ones <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">主从/组复制可跨区，延迟看网络 社区共识。 双写多活无原生冲突解决，生产禁区 社区共识。 Group Replication 跨区对延迟敏感 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>主从/组复制可跨区，延迟看网络 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>双写多活无原生冲突解决，生产禁区 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Group Replication 跨区对延迟敏感 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Primary-replica / Group Replication can span regions; latency follows the network <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. No native conflict resolution for dual-write active-active; off-l…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Primary-replica / Group Replication can span regions; latency follows the network <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No native conflict resolution for dual-write active-active; off-limits in production <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Group Replication is latency-sensitive across regions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">MHA 手动/半自动切，RTO 分钟级，有脑裂风险 社区共识。 MGR/InnoDB Cluster 原生自动切，RTO 秒到分钟，但运维复杂 官方文档。 半同步复制可保 RPO≈0，异步则可能丢数 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>MHA 手动/半自动切，RTO 分钟级，有脑裂风险 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>MGR/InnoDB Cluster 原生自动切，RTO 秒到分钟，但运维复杂 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>半同步复制可保 RPO≈0，异步则可能丢数 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">MHA manual/semi-auto cutover: minutes of RTO with split-brain risk <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. MGR/InnoDB Cluster fail over natively in seconds-to-minutes but are complex to r…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>MHA manual/semi-auto cutover: minutes of RTO with split-brain risk <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>MGR/InnoDB Cluster fail over natively in seconds-to-minutes but are complex to run <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Semi-sync keeps RPO≈0; async can lose data <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">MySQL 社区版无原生行级安全，行级隔离只能靠视图、存储过程或应用层 WHERE 过滤实现，绕开风险高 社区共识 MySQL 企业版提供 Data Masking and De-Identification 组件，支持在 SELECT 返回时对字段脱敏（如 mask_pan 等函数） 官方文档 列级权限可通过 GRANT SELECT(…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>MySQL 社区版无原生行级安全，行级隔离只能靠视图、存储过程或应用层 WHERE 过滤实现，绕开风险高 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>MySQL 企业版提供 Data Masking and De-Identification 组件，支持在 SELECT 返回时对字段脱敏（如 mask_pan 等函数） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>列级权限可通过 GRANT SELECT(col) 实现，但无动态脱敏策略引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>主要成本风险：完整脱敏能力绑定商业版，社区版用户只能换企业版或自研 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Community Edition has no native row-level security; row isolation relies on views, stored procedures, or app-layer WHERE filters, which are easy to bypass (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Community Edition has no native row-level security; row isolation relies on views, stored procedures, or app-layer WHERE filters, which are easy to bypass <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>MySQL Enterprise Edition ships a Data Masking and De-Identification component that masks fields at SELECT time (e.g. mask_pan) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Column-level GRANT SELECT(col) exists, but there is no dynamic masking policy engine <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Main cost risk: full masking capability is tied to the commercial edition <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（原生 JSON+虚拟列索引）</span><p class=\"snippet\">原生二进制 JSON，-&gt;&gt;/JSON_TABLE，虚拟生成列建索引 官方文档。 JSON 列无法直接建索引（需虚拟列），大 JSON 更新整列重写 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>原生二进制 JSON，-&gt;&gt;/JSON_TABLE，虚拟生成列建索引 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>JSON 列无法直接建索引（需虚拟列），大 JSON 更新整列重写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Native binary JSON, -&gt;&gt;/JSON_TABLE, indexes via virtual generated columns <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No direct JSON indexes (need virtual columns); big JSON updates rewrite whole c…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Native binary JSON, -&gt;&gt;/JSON_TABLE, indexes via virtual generated columns <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No direct JSON indexes (need virtual columns); big JSON updates rewrite whole column <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "mysql__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">FULLTEXT 索引，ngram parser 中文分词 官方文档。 相关性算法简单，大规模检索弱于 ES 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>FULLTEXT 索引，ngram parser 中文分词 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>相关性算法简单，大规模检索弱于 ES <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">FULLTEXT with ngram parser for Chinese <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Simple relevance; weaker than ES at scale <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>FULLTEXT with ngram parser for Chinese <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Simple relevance; weaker than ES at scale <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});